   "op": "note",
   "text": "Left My Heart path: Frank Weathers, in Vegas, tells his story (Topic014: iFamilyDialogue, 016, 000) and asks the player to find his family (Topic001, begin script: objective 10, iMetFrank, ShowMap of Cottonwood Cove); at the cove Canyon Runner is asked about captives (Topic002: CapturesMentioned 2), is asked to sell them (Topic016: iBuySlaves 1), talked down with a lie (Topic007, Speech 50: iBuySlaves 2) and sold them for 150 caps (Topic009: the collar key, objective 10 completed); with the pen gate unlocked Mrs. Weathers greets (objective 50) and is freed (Topic007: objective 50 completed, 100 shown); Frank hears they are alive (Topic015, Topic004 0x000FB8F6: objective 100 completed, CompleteQuest). The quest's stages are 0 (Fail: Frank dead) and 100, which nothing sets, so no stage is reached on this path. Stand-ins: travel by move_player; 300 caps, a bobby pin by add_item; the player carries no Mark of Caesar (with it, before Caesar is met, Canyon Runner only sends the player to Lucullus); Speech 50 and Lockpick 50 given (set_av); the pen gate unlocked by its key (Unlock by console line: the key's use on the gate)."
