   "op": "note",
   "text": "Eye for an Eye path: at Camp Searchlight First Sergeant Astor, met once before and once Cottonwood Cove is on the map with fast travel, is told of the Legion camp (Topic142, whose lines are Topic006's, shared by Info Connection: iAstorAsked 1; Topic143) and gives the NCR bug (Topic145: StartQuest, objectives 10, 20, 30); at the cove the player takes the Legion's notes from Aurelius's desk and the plans from a filing cabinet (their OnAdd blocks: objectives 10, 20) and plants the bug in the Legion radio (NVCCLegionRadioSCRIPT, button 0: objective 30, 40 shown); Astor takes the intel (Topic150 'an update on Cottonwood Cove', again Topic006's shared lines; 152: objective 40, Polatli's EyeForAnEye 2, 153) and hears the offer to clear the cove (155, 156: objective 90); the player picks the lock of the truck by the docks (NVCCTruckDoorSCRIPT, button 1, Lockpick 50 and a bobby pin) and its barrels poison the cove (iRadiationKill 1, the camp leaders killed by the script, objectives 90 and 95 completed, 100 shown); Astor's thanks for the cove (Topic150, 160, 161 at iRadiationKill 1: 100, Complete Quest). Stand-ins: travel by move_player; taking from the desk and cabinet by remove_all_items (everything in them comes along); the Legion's notice of the player is not modelled (they do not see him take the intel)."
